WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.120
- Do your kids like when you
do the Olaf voice though?

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:02.953
- They hate it.

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.630
They hate it because the Olaf voice,

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:08.833
that this is the voice right?

00:00:09.812 --> 00:00:13.480
So, I tried for a while
reading them "Frozen" books,

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:16.320
and I thought it was so cool,
even though I do a horrible

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.840
Anna and Elsa.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.660
But, they were just over it.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.680
They didn't want it anymore,
so I started reading

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.420
the "Harry Potter" books at their school.

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:26.113
So every Friday, I go in.
- You do?

00:00:26.113 --> 00:00:28.580
- I read all of book one
last year to the kids.

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:31.260
I read all of book two, but spoiler alert,

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.253
guess which two children
refused to come to the readings?

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.110
- [Kelly] It's 'cause you're the dad,

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:36.943
yeah.
- Right here.

00:00:36.943 --> 00:00:40.850
So I will be sitting in front
of like a group of 40 children

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.820
all their friends, and
they'll like walk in

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:45.917
with their book bags and
be like "Hey dad, you good?

00:00:45.917 --> 00:00:47.950
"All right, we're just
gonna go play back there."

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:51.840
I'm like, this was for bonding.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.900
- This was for bonding where are you?

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.320
- I'm not getting paid for this.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.010
- But that's gotta be amazing for them.

00:00:59.010 --> 00:00:59.843
That would be amazing.

00:00:59.843 --> 00:01:01.030
- It would, you would think.

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:02.450
- No, I mean the other kids as well.

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:04.150
To have you come and do
that, that's amazing!

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:04.983
- Oh, it's great.

00:01:04.983 --> 00:01:08.120
And they pay me under the
table, so it makes it all worth.

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:09.920
Those kids pay me under the table.

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:11.450
- In like Skittles.

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:12.620
- No, hard cash.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:13.747
- Hard cash.

00:01:13.747 --> 00:01:14.580
- Hard cash.

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:15.616
- And I'll take your lunch money.

00:01:15.616 --> 00:01:17.266
- And I'll take your lunch money.

